---

<BaseLayout
  title="机场导航｜2026常用机场代理、测速工具与客户端下载导航 - VPN查房"
  description="2026稳定机场代理导航与网络工具目录。宿管例行巡查验证，精选优质IEPL专线机场直达、主流代理客户端下载配置教程与网络测速工具大全，防失联、防走丢。"
  keywords={[
    '机场导航',
    '机场推荐',
    '2026最稳定的机场',
    'IEPL专线',
    'Clash下载',
    '小火箭配置',
    '网络测速工具',
    'VPN查房导航'
  ]}
>
  <div class="container nav-portal-page">
    <div class="page-layout-grid">
      <div class="main-column">
        <!-- Page Header -->
        <div class="page-header industrial-box">
          <div class="header-top font-mono">
            <span class="industrial-badge industrial-badge-red">🧭 查房导航室</span>
            <span class="text-muted">编号: NAV-2026-PORTAL</span>
          </div>
          <h1 class="page-title">🧭 机场导航：优质机场直达、必备工具与测速大全</h1>
          <p class="page-intro">
            为出海租客精心梳理的 2026 全景导航卷宗。拒绝花里胡哨与虚假宣传，所有收录服务均经宿管大爷每周例行突击抓包抽检。从优质专线直达、全平台客户端安装，到网络丢包测试工具，一站直达！
          </p>

          <!-- Quick Jump Anchors -->
          <div class="nav-jump-bar font-mono">
            <span class="jump-label">快速跳转:</span>
            <a href="#featured" class="jump-pill">⭐ 五星推荐机场</a>
            <a href="#clients" class="jump-pill">💻 客户端下载</a>
            <a href="#diagnostics" class="jump-pill">📊 测速与诊断</a>
            <a href="#blacklist" class="jump-pill">🚨 跑路避坑专栏</a>
          </div>

          <div class="stamp-position">
            <StampWatermark text="查房导航·实测核准专章" size="sm" />
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Section 1: Featured Airports -->
        <section id="featured" class="nav-section">
          <div class="section-banner industrial-box">
            <div class="section-badge-bar">
              <span class="cat-pill red font-mono">⭐ 五星推荐</span>
              <h2 class="section-heading">🏆 2026 稳定优质专线机场直达导航</h2>
            </div>
            <p class="section-subtext">
              经 7×24 小时连续抓包与晚高峰严苛考验，连接稳定低丢包，适合主力工作、4K影音与跨境外贸。
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="nav-cards-grid">
            {featuredAirports.map((item) => (
              <div class="nav-card industrial-box">
                <div class="nav-card-header">
                  <div class="nav-card-title-group">
                    <h3 class="nav-card-name">{item.name}</h3>
                    <span class="nav-type-tag font-mono">{item.type}</span>
                  </div>
                  <span class={`nav-badge-pill pill-${item.badgeType} font-mono`}>
                    {item.tag}
                  </span>
                </div>

                <p class="nav-card-desc">{item.desc}</p>

                <div class="nav-card-footer">
                  <span class="rating-box font-mono" title="宿管综合评分">
                    ★ {item.rating}
                  </span>
                  <div class="nav-btn-group">
                    <a href={item.reviewUrl} class="btn-review">
                      📖 详细实测
                    </a>
                    <a href={item.officialUrl} target="_blank" rel="noopener sponsored" class="btn-visit">
                      直达官网 ➔
                    </a>
                  </div>
                </div>
              </div>
            ))}
          </div>
        </section>

        <!-- Section 3: Client Downloads & Tutorials -->
        <section id="clients" class="nav-section">
          <div class="section-banner industrial-box">
            <div class="section-badge-bar">
              <span class="cat-pill dark font-mono">💻 必备工具</span>
              <h2 class="section-heading">🛠️ 全平台客户端官方下载与配置教程</h2>
            </div>
            <p class="section-subtext">
              工欲善其事，必先利其器。精选各操作系统下主流好用的开源代理客户端与本站图文配置教程。
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="client-cards-grid">
            {clientTools.map((client) => (
              <div class="client-card industrial-box">
                <div class="client-top">
                  <span class="client-platform font-mono">{client.platform}</span>
                  <span class="client-badge font-mono">{client.badge}</span>
                </div>
                <h3 class="client-name">{client.name}</h3>
                <p class="client-desc">{client.desc}</p>
                <div class="client-action">
                  <a href={client.tutorialUrl} class="btn-tutorial">
                    📖 查看新手配置教程 ➔
                  </a>
                </div>
              </div>
            ))}
          </div>
        </section>

        <!-- Section 4: Network Diagnostics & Speedtest -->
        <section id="diagnostics" class="nav-section">
          <div class="section-banner industrial-box">
            <div class="section-badge-bar">
              <span class="cat-pill green font-mono">📊 查房利器</span>
              <h2 class="section-heading">🔬 常用网络测速、路由追踪与 IP 纯净度工具</h2>
            </div>
            <p class="section-subtext">
              遇到断流卡顿先别慌，使用宿管大爷同款网络分析工具，轻松定位丢包与线路拥堵瓶颈。
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="tools-list-grid">
            {diagnosticTools.map((tool) => (
              <a href={tool.url} target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="tool-item-card industrial-box">
                <div class="tool-title-row">
                  <span class="tool-icon font-mono">🌐</span>
                  <strong class="tool-name">{tool.name}</strong>
                  <span class="tool-arrow font-mono">↗</span>
                </div>
                <p class="tool-desc">{tool.desc}</p>
              </a>
            ))}
          </div>
        </section>

        <!-- Section 5: Scam / Blacklist Warning -->
        <section id="blacklist" class="nav-section">
          <div class="warning-callout-card industrial-box">
            <div class="warning-header">
              <span class="warning-siren">🚨</span>
              <h3 class="warning-title">宿管防踩坑告示：警惕低价跑路与虚标陷阱</h3>
            </div>
            <p class="warning-text">
              近年来“包年9.9元”、“无限流量”等营销噱头层出不穷，很多服务商圈钱数月后便拔线提桶跑路。宿管大爷提醒大家：<strong>切记首选月付</strong>，保留测试凭据，定期关注本站「跑路机场」黑榜卷宗！
            </p>
            <div class="warning-actions font-mono">
              <a href="/category/meishou" class="btn-danger">
                🚨 查看「跑路机场」拉闸避坑卷宗 ➔
              </a>
              <a href="/category/zhuabao" class="btn-neutral">
                🔍 查阅「机场评测」实测抓包数据 ➔
              </a>
            </div>
          </div>
        </section>
      </div>

      <!-- Right Sidebar Column -->
      <aside class="right-sidebar-column">
        <RightNav activeId="01" title="⚡ 热门机场速览" />

        <!-- Sidebar Bulletin Card -->
        <div class="sidebar-info-card industrial-box">
          <div class="info-card-header">
            <span class="badge-tag font-mono">宿管公告</span>
            <span class="text-xs font-mono">LIVE</span>
          </div>
          <h4 class="info-title">💡 导航使用小贴士</h4>
          <ul class="info-list">
            <li>所有机场均提供 7×24 小时每周巡检报告。</li>
            <li>建议将本站加入书签，防备节点突发失联。</li>
            <li>遇紧急故障可查阅对应的客户端错误码排查。</li>
          </ul>
          <div class="info-footer">
            <a href="/handbook" class="link-handbook font-mono">
              📖 查阅防坑手册 ➔
            </a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </aside>
    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .nav-portal-page {
    max-width: 1200px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding-top: 1.5rem;
    padding-bottom: 3.5rem;
  }

  .page-layout-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    gap: 2rem;
    align-items: start;
  }

  @media (min-width: 992px) {
    .page-layout-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr 320px;
      gap: 3rem;
    }
    .right-sidebar-column {
      position: sticky;
      top: 5rem;
    }
  }

  .page-header {
    background: #ffffff;
    padding: 1.8rem;
    position: relative;
    margin-bottom: 2.5rem;
  }

  .header-top {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.8rem;
    margin-bottom: 0.8rem;
  }

  .page-title {
    font-size: 2rem;
    font-weight: 900;
    margin-top: 0.2rem;
    margin-bottom: 0.8rem;
    line-height: 1.3;
  }

  .page-intro {
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    color: #444444;
    line-height: 1.7;
    margin-bottom: 1.2rem;
  }

  .nav-jump-bar {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    background: #f9f8f3;
    padding: 0.6rem 0.8rem;
    border: 1.5px dashed #111111;
  }

  .jump-label {
    font-weight: 800;
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    color: #111111;
  }

  .jump-pill {
    font-size: 0.82rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    padding: 0.2rem 0.55rem;
    background: #ffffff;
    border: 1px solid #111111;
    color: #111111;
    text-decoration: none;
    transition: all 0.15s ease;
  }

  .jump-pill:hover {
    background: var(--accent-red);
    color: #ffffff;
    box-shadow: 2px 2px 0px #111111;
  }

  .stamp-position {
    position: absolute;
    right: 1.5rem;
    top: 1.5rem;
  }

  /* Sections */
  .nav-section {
    margin-bottom: 3rem;
  }

  .section-banner {
    background: #ffffff;
    padding: 1.2rem 1.5rem;
    margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
  }

  .section-badge-bar {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.75rem;
    margin-bottom: 0.4rem;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
  }

  .cat-pill {
    display: inline-block;
    padding: 0.15rem 0.5rem;
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    border: 1px solid #111111;
  }

  .cat-pill.red {
    background: #fee2e2;
    color: #dc2626;
  }

  .cat-pill.orange {
    background: #ffedd5;
    color: #ea580c;
  }

  .cat-pill.dark {
    background: #18181b;
    color: #ffffff;
  }

  .cat-pill.green {
    background: #dcfce7;
    color: #16a34a;
  }

  .section-heading {
    font-size: 1.35rem;
    font-weight: 900;
    margin: 0;
  }

  .section-subtext {
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    color: #555555;
    margin: 0;
  }

  /* Airport Cards Grid */
  .nav-cards-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    gap: 1.25rem;
  }

  @media (min-width: 680px) {
    .nav-cards-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    }
  }

  .nav-card {
    background: #ffffff;
    padding: 1.25rem;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    justify-content: space-between;
    transition: transform 0.15s ease, box-shadow 0.15s ease;
  }

  .nav-card:hover {
    transform: translateY(-2px);
    box-shadow: 4px 4px 0px #111111;
  }

  .nav-card-header {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: flex-start;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    margin-bottom: 0.7rem;
    border-bottom: 1.5px dashed #e5e5e5;
    padding-bottom: 0.6rem;
  }

  .nav-card-title-group {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
  }

  .nav-card-name {
    font-size: 1.2rem;
    font-weight: 900;
    margin: 0;
    color: #111111;
  }

  .nav-type-tag {
    font-size: 0.72rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    background: #e5e5e5;
    padding: 0.1rem 0.35rem;
    border: 1px solid #777;
    color: #333;
  }

  .nav-badge-pill {
    font-size: 0.72rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    padding: 0.15rem 0.45rem;
    border: 1px solid #111111;
    white-space: nowrap;
  }

  .pill-red {
    background: #fee2e2;
    color: #dc2626;
  }

  .pill-green {
    background: #dcfce7;
    color: #16a34a;
  }

  .pill-dark {
    background: #18181b;
    color: #ffffff;
  }

  .pill-orange {
    background: #ffedd5;
    color: #ea580c;
  }

  .nav-card-desc {
    font-size: 0.92rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: #444444;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
    flex-grow: 1;
  }

  .nav-card-footer {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    padding-top: 0.6rem;
    border-top: 1.5px solid #f0eee6;
  }

  .rating-box {
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    font-weight: 900;
    color: #b45309;
    background: #fef3c7;
    padding: 0.15rem 0.4rem;
    border: 1px solid #d97706;
  }

  .nav-btn-group {
    display: flex;
    gap: 0.5rem;
  }

  .btn-review {
    font-size: 0.82rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    padding: 0.3rem 0.6rem;
    background: #f4f2eb;
    border: 1.5px solid #111111;
    color: #111111;
    text-decoration: none;
    transition: all 0.15s ease;
  }

  .btn-review:hover {
    background: #111111;
    color: #ffffff;
  }

  .btn-visit {
    font-size: 0.82rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    padding: 0.3rem 0.75rem;
    background: var(--accent-red);
    border: 1.5px solid #111111;
    color: #ffffff;
    text-decoration: none;
    box-shadow: 2px 2px 0px #111111;
    transition: all 0.15s ease;
  }

  .btn-visit:hover {
    transform: translate(-1px, -1px);
    box-shadow: 3px 3px 0px #111111;
  }

  /* Budget Grid */
  .budget-grid {
    grid-template-columns: 1fr;
  }

  @media (min-width: 680px) {
    .budget-grid {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    }
  }

